  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">First Road Infraestructure Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Primer Programa de Infraestructura Vial</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">La primera operacin especfica, coadyuva con el objetivo general del CCLIP y con lo previsto en el Plan Nacional de Desarrollo (PND) mediante la mejora sostenible de las condiciones del transporte de carga y pasajeros en la red vial nacional (RVN).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The first specific operation will contribute to the general objective of the Conditional credit line for investment projects (CCLIP) and the content of the National Development Plan (PND) by making sustainable improvements in the level of serviceability of the national highway system (RVN).</narrative>
  </description>
